<speak>Early morning is nicest, although I don't always manage it. If I'm home, I'll sometimes go out before breakfast and then come back feeling more awake. After lunch, I keep it short and stay where there's shade. I also like walking somewhere with trees instead of along a busy road. It doesn't have to be far. I used to think a walk only counted if I went a long distance, but now I enjoy being outside without measuring it.</speak>